@ 17.10.1.2 - Proto-Indo-Aryan to Eastern Middle Indo-Aryan
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Shukla, Shaligram (1974), “Phonological change and dialect variation in Middle-Indo-Aryan”. In Anderson, J., and C. Jones (Eds.), Historical Linguistics II:391-401.
